From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Spatiand build <claude@prasetya.id>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:29:16 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Spatiand: files chosen in Spatiand's own chooser, on every
 system

The owner, 2026-11-27: "do make this for 159. spatimesh is spatiand app" -- SpatiMesh reaching the
room's remotes when a page wants a file, Save as, a download's place or a folder to upload. The room's
chooser (crates/spatiand-choose, a window of the room run as a program that writes what was chosen)
offers them; SpatiMesh asked it only on the Beam Pro (android-libc/0019) and on the Mac (its port's
own copy), and the Deck's asked the desktop portal. Now one file dialog for every system: in the room
-- whose own programs' folder it says to every program it starts as SPATIAND_APPS_DIR -- the chooser
there, as spatiand-choose or, in an APK's library folder, libspatiand-choose.so; outside it, the
desktop's own, as before. It starts where the page asked, else where the last choice was, else
Downloads, else Android's own Download folder where Spatiand may read it. Replaces android-libc/0019
and the Mac port's copy.
---
